{"summary":"third-person shooter in a cyberpunk world","description":"Mindcell — is the third-person adventure in the world of the near future. The protagonist is sentenced to become material for scientific experiments, but he’s not going to put up with such a fate at all. In search of a way out, he must recall what happened to him and how he got here.\nThe persecutors will not leave the fugitive alone, wherever he’s going.\nAnd there is a serious confrontation ahead. Going through the story with the main character, try to find out the goals of your pursuers and understand who your real ally is.\n\nGame Features:\n+ An exciting story with dialogs, characters and puzzles.\n+ The campaign is filled with intrigue and battle.\n+ A variety of locations, enemies and bosses.\n+ Close combat clashes and intense skirmishes.\n+ Intense and diligently made graphics.\n+ Good optimization and the ability to tune performance.\n+ Simple controls, giving complete freedom of action.\n+ Gamepad support","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood, Language","pegiNotes":"Strong Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/egE-1acgOwo?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WMH2Roypz2Chys5g4EbFzDp9GzGKLBpi9kvRKDMa6sFFwrJZ8nem4s5uSwG6CAjK6mX9KocypajBeXWBbjwIXQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LPS9gmP-_5fmYCsxKX8KMt5nCxEt_tIl4PuwM2PJTp_UVdhuhH1m5HQkMbfMnmkWiF02cAMU6j_PO1Sd3Zlw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vPW99CVDuY74pRgfOyiWcTDeWfTnVv_Kj3q8u4MDcjMa1r69QDLUnNGrrgtclUIlv_BPoylaQ8_U3axV9CXY","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lJ1sDKgEpdxfu5XpHXSLkZO8PkkmfZ4DfWPzq6d2LblMr2QgPCiLdV7HDd1EjnUdP85OPrT1EfEsdnU3enfdnw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DTwaKnsX2H9oSFAMhiUhB3ORAXF2VTPmU6BnTtjSt9HYiljjJ-KxrAhucr3-S7oR_GUQNavmbW3xmbUayKNG","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9AI82l88goyOPe0J-DnXiv6DH9AVMPwcpJDpqC5on4Bn_XP-d3tEAEI3P-pUXiAne2MDF1uVQKKesVXAOmsvZg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wN2B